%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "14px"}}}%%
%% Diagram: LLM Cost Spike Incident Response Flow
%% Purpose : Guides the on-call engineer from a cost-spike alert through
%%           traffic analysis, prompt inspection, throttle decisions,
%%           and root-cause remediation.
%% Usage   : Render with Mermaid CLI or the GitHub Mermaid renderer.
%%           Referenced by runbooks/llm_cost_spike.md
flowchart TD
    A(["💸 Cost Spike Alert Fires\n(spend > 2x 7-day rolling average\nor token budget > 80%)"]) --> B

    B{"Traffic volume spike?\n(requests > 3x p95 baseline)"}

    B -- Yes --> C["Enable request throttle\nApply rate-limit at API gateway\nCapacity team alerted"]
    B -- No --> D["Inspect prompt / token growth\nQuery token_usage_log table\nCompare avg tokens per request"]

    C --> E{"Throttle reduced spend\nwithin 10 minutes?"}
    E -- Yes --> F["Log rate-limit change\nMonitor for SLA impact"]
    E -- No --> G["Escalate to SEV-1\nEngage LLM provider support\nConsider circuit-breaker"]

    D --> H{"Token count per request\nincreased > 40%?"}

    H -- Yes --> I["Identify changed prompt templates\nCheck recent deploys for prompt diffs\nRoll back if confirmed"]
    H -- No --> J{"New integration or\nclient sending bulk requests?"}

    J -- Yes --> K["Contact integration owner\nApply per-client quota\nOpen non-urgent incident"]
    J -- No --> L["Check provider pricing changes\nReview cost attribution tags\nEscalate to FinOps"] 

    I --> M["Confirm rollback reduced token usage\nCapture diff in postmortem"]
    K --> N["Monitor spend for 30 minutes\nVerify quota effective"]
    L --> O["Adjust internal budget alert\nthreshold if pricing changed\nDocument in CHANGELOG"]
    F --> P["Review rate-limit impact on users\nAdjust burst allowance if needed"]
    G --> Q["War-room: SRE + ML Platform\nDecide on provider fallback"]

    M --> R["Validate 1-hour spend trend\nis returning to baseline"]
    N --> R
    O --> R
    P --> R
    Q --> R

    R --> S{"Spend trending down?"}
    S -- No --> D
    S -- Yes --> T["Write postmortem\nUpdate budget alerts\nClose incident"]

    style A fill:#f59e0b,color:#000
    style G fill:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style Q fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style T fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
